gen-vectors

# M8 build artefacts: the fuzz binaries, the fuzzer's own findings, and
# the staging root `make install DESTDIR=` writes into. fuzz/corpus is
# generated from WIRE.md §9 by `make fuzz-corpus`, so it is regenerable
# rather than source -- and a corpus that grew during a campaign is
# machine-specific noise nobody should be reviewing in a diff.
fuzz-frame
fuzz-frame-repro
fuzz/corpus/
crash-*
leak-*
timeout-*
oom-*
/stage/
